    stem: `A logistics company is choosing a compute option for a new shipment-tracking service. The service is packaged as a self-contained unit that bundles the application code and its dependencies, several instances of it will run on the same host machine, and the operations team does not want to install, patch, or manage an operating system for each running instance. Which compute type meets these requirements?`,
